"><strong>What Comes Next</strong></h2><p class=3D"">The properties are nec=
essary but not sufficient. An aligned system also needs feedback loops that=
 actually close, an honest accounting of where the framework breaks, and ev=
idence that it compounds across projects rather than resetting with each ne=
w engagement. In<a href=3D"https://www.8090.ai/blog/part-4-how-alignment-co=
